<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Welcome to LaunchTrace Food</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;background:#f5f5f4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1c1917;">
<div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px;">
  <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#78716c;">LaunchTrace Food</p>
  <h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;">You're subscribed</h1>
  <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">Hello{% if contact_name %} {{ contact_name }}{% endif %},</p>
  <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">
    {{ company }} is now subscribed to the LaunchTrace Food weekly feed on the {{ plan_name }} plan
    (£{{ '%.2f'|format(price_pence/100) }} per month). Your first feed arrives on the next Friday run.
  </p>
  <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">Each Friday you'll get:</p>
  <ul style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;">
    <li>Newly published UK food-brand trade mark filings, filtered to packaged consumer products</li>
    <li>Companies House verification and company age for each brand</li>
    <li>A LaunchTrace Score with the reasons behind it</li>
    <li>Inferred supplier relevance for packaging, manufacturing, distribution and fulfilment</li>
    <li>A CSV your sales team can work from directly</li>
  </ul>
  <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">
    You can add up to {{ max_recipients }} recipients from {{ company }}. Reply to this email with the
    addresses and we'll add them.
  </p>
  <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">Cancel any time — <a href="{{ manage_url }}" style="color:#0369a1;">manage your subscription</a>.</p>
  <p style="margin-top:24px;font-size:12px;color:#78716c;">
    Source: UK Intellectual Property Office and Companies House data under the Open Government Licence v3.0.
  </p>
</div></body></html>
